us your network IP address. A refresh requests the forecast, current conditions and a separate Open-Meteo air-quality reading. Air quality is shown as United States AQI; if that request fails, the weather reading still works and AQI is shown as unavailable. After you enable weather and select a city, opening or resuming the app may refresh a stale cached forecast at most once an hour. There is no background network polling. This app uses Open-Meteo as a personal, noncommercial service and shows attribution. Forecasts are cached privately and are not uploaded.&#10;&#10;Open-Meteo terms: https://open-meteo.com/en/terms&#10;Open-Meteo site: https://open-meteo.com/" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[122,317][958,1200]" /><node text="Weather is off. No requests are made." content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[122,1200][958,1279]" /><node text="Enable weather (network requests only after this)" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="true" bounds="[122,1279][958,1408]" /><node text="City search" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[122,1408][958,1492]" /><node text="Type a city, then Search" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="true" bounds="[122,1492][958,1610]" /><node text="SEARCH CITY" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="true" bounds="[122,1610][958,1736]" /><node text="Temperature unit" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[122,1736][958,1820]" /><node text="" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="false" bounds="[122,1820][958,1904]"><node text="Celsius (&#176;C)" content-desc="" resource-id="" package="com.dotwelwidgets.dotwellabs" clickable="true" bounds="[12